OL,3,AIkea cuts prices as customers struggle
OL,4,Awith rising cost of living
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwedish furniture giant Ikea is cutting
OL,7,Fprices across hundreds of products in
OL,8,FEurope to woo customers struggling with
OL,9,Fdeepening cost-of-living pressures.
OL,11,FIkea has seen revenue decline over the
OL,12,Fpast two years as the rising cost of
OL,13,Fliving reduces people's ability to
OL,14,Finvest in new furniture and home
OL,15,Frenovations.
OL,17,FThe company is spending bB,1.2bn (#1bn)
OL,18,Fon the price cuts to items including
OL,19,Fthe Billy bookcase and Kallax storage
OL,20,Funits, with reductions of up to 28% on
OL,21,Fcertain products.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
