OL,3,AIkea cuts prices as customers struggle
OL,4,Awith rising cost of living
OL,5,
OL,6,FIkea said it could make the cuts by
OL,7,Fmaking savings throughout the supply
OL,8,Fchain, such as packaging costs, but
OL,9,Facknowledged profits may take a hit.
